and gain recognition of the presence of your divine love and mercy

00:39:28.960 --> 00:39:31.420
for these students will be their first time

00:39:32.000 --> 00:39:34.659
being in a ramadan here on campus

00:39:35.280 --> 00:39:39.819
for our community members who are coming back and will be joining us as well

00:39:40.400 --> 00:39:43.420
we ask allah that for all of us and our loved ones

00:39:43.920 --> 00:39:45.060
that you make it an

00:39:45.760 --> 00:39:48.620
experience that is uplifting and fulfilling

00:39:49.440 --> 00:39:55.119
one that rejuvenates our hearts and replenishes parts of ourselves that we didn't even know were

00:39:55.119 --> 00:39:56.460
in need of rejuvenation

00:39:58.000 --> 00:40:00.980
make it a means through which we draw closer to you ya

00:40:03.119 --> 00:40:04.479
and throughout it all

00:40:05.040 --> 00:40:09.280
help us to take advantage of every moment that comes to our way

00:40:09.920 --> 00:40:11.860
leaving not any of it behind

00:40:12.720 --> 00:40:17.520
protect us always from parts that are not humble tongues that are not wise and eyes

00:40:17.520 --> 00:40:18.880
that have forgotten how to cry

00:40:19.520 --> 00:40:23.360
forgive us for our shortcomings and guide and bless us all rabbana
